Package: installed-software
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: App Steward Contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, python3-apt, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, pkexec, apt, dpkg
Description: App Steward software inventory and package management utility
 Aggregates Debian packages, Flatpak applications, Snap packages,
 desktop entries and AppImages in a GTK4 desktop interface.
 Removal operations are separately authorized and conservatively validated.
